    "background_story": "Cutie was a gentle and affectionate cat who loved nothing more than snuggling with her owner, Emma. However, one day Emma brought home a new puppy, Max, without warning Cutie. The sudden introduction of this rambunctious interloper sent Cutie into a tailspin. She was upset by the disruption to her peaceful routine and felt threatened by the attention Max was receiving. Cutie began to act out, knocking over vases and scratching furniture. Emma was taken aback by Cutie's behavior, but soon realized that she needed to reassure her beloved cat that she was still loved and cherished. With patience and extra attention, Emma helped Cutie adjust to the new addition to the family, and eventually, Cutie learned to tolerate Max's energetic presence.",
